      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. The dose looks like it might be a typo, so I want to check with you first.\n\n**The problem:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6,400 mg/day**.\n- The usual maximum single dose is **800 mg**, so 1600 mg is double that.\n- The usual prescription maximum is **3,200 mg/day**, and this order is twice that.\n- Doses this high carry a much greater risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury and heart problems, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Did you mean one of these?**\n1. **400 mg four times daily**: 1,600 mg/day total, which may be where the \"1600\" came from.\n2. **800 mg four times daily**: 3,200 mg/day, the maximum prescription dose.\n3. **Something else**: tell me the dose and frequency.\n\nIf you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and give me the reason. I'll put the reason in the order note, but expect pharmacy to flag it."
      }
     ],
